    "body": "STARTED：LAB-10 后端工程师在 feat/lab-10-library 独立 worktree 实施。改动限定 src/server/lab/library*、src/protocol/lab/library* 与 Lab RPC 接缝，不改 UI/Paseo。依赖 runtime 证据：LAB-02 https://github.com/Pepgent/Pepgent/pull/33；STO-11 https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/261；LIB-01 https://github.com/Pepgent/lab-library/issues/1。stage 行只保存意图，定义读 git；apply 经 Panel clone 与选路径三方合并，push 成功后快进中心检出。usage 只读 store。",
